Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.11,0:00:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老公
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.24,0:00:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.68,0:00:12.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老公
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.43,0:00:29.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好难受\N明明酒量很差的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.33,0:00:33.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么会醉成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.77,0:00:37.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.11,0:00:47.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都叫你别不要喝这么多了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.69,0:00:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,起得来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.13,0:00:57.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老公
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.73,0:01:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听见吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.70,0:01:14.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉，我阻止不了他一直喝\N太抱歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.68,0:01:18.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还要你送他回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.02,0:01:23.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会  他一个人回不了家的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.26,0:01:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.46,0:01:32.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太太
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.46,0:01:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有点难开口
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:44.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实我们回来的时候没电车了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.01,0:01:54.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天我可以留下来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.35,0:01:58.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.19,0:02:01.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才该说抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.78,0:02:19.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请用
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.71,0:02:22.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.52,0:02:27.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他睡了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.92,0:02:33.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道是睡了还是晕过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.93,0:02:37.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.12,0:03:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还不打算睡吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.56,0:03:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最近睡眠状态不好，\N现在还睡不着
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.23,0:03:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.60,0:03:56.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用理我，你休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.64,0:03:59.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.29,0:04:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太太，你对催眠术有兴趣吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.03,0:04:26.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,催眠术吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.90,0:04:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最近我学了一点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.01,0:04:40.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好像很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.52,0:04:50.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,催眠可以舒解内心的压力的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.56,0:04:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有兴趣的话  可以找我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.67,0:05:05.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实我也不是很有兴趣的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.05,0:05:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没想到.. 之后居然发生了那种事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.21,0:05:43.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  要你特地来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.75,0:05:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不用工作吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.49,0:05:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚好出差经过
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.35,0:06:23.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太太，真的可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.62,0:06:30.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯，我最近有点失眠
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.46,0:06:35.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.67,0:06:40.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.20,0:07:09.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉很正统耶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.37,0:07:13.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,紧张起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.87,0:07:17.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.61,0:07:20.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又不是什么特别的魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.31,0:07:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你放松就好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.15,0:07:26.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯..
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.92,0:07:35.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在一直盯着节拍器看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.14,0:07:54.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是人类最容易集中的节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.11,0:08:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,平常有什么负面情绪，\N或是不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.15,0:08:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,光是听见这节奏，\N就能有效平静身心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.43,0:08:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这BMP75的节奏，\N是最能打动人心的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.58,0:08:29.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,BMP75？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.45,0:08:35.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好好看着，脑袋跟着这节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.11,0:08:58.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.05,0:09:05.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉..身心都舒适了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.39,0:09:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么，请慢慢闭上眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.84,0:09:31.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请想象一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.01,0:09:38.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你躺在大自然上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.05,0:09:46.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听见风吹动草原的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.36,0:09:54.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,附近有河流，\N你听见河水流动的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.63,0:09:59.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接着..
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.34,0:10:08.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在吃一个非常甜美的哈蜜瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.65,0:10:12.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常甜美
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.29,0:10:19.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吃得口水都流下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.09,0:10:23.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常甜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.76,0:10:28.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又大又甜的哈蜜瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.31,0:10:40.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的嘴巴里..
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.88,0:10:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在..
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.42,0:10:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吃着哈蜜瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.92,0:10:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大口吃着
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.76,0:11:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常多汁的哈蜜瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.17,0:11:18.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听见手指的声音后，\N你醒来时感到非常舒适
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.32,0:11:26.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,3、 2、 1
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.75,0:11:49.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.75,0:11:51.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在感觉如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.02,0:11:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉..
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.55,0:12:01.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好像吃过很好吃的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.80,0:12:11.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.24,0:12:16.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太太，你是容易被催眠的体质
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.57,0:12:22.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚才的只是浅层催眠
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.61,0:12:26.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我突然..有点害怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.12,0:12:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的，不会有什么奇怪的催眠
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.26,0:12:40.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要再来一次吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.37,0:12:49.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯..
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.08,0:12:56.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.00,0:13:26.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次请一直盯着这铜币
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.68,0:13:39.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你浮在空中
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.26,0:13:48.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,飞越了地球，来到了浩瀚的太空
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.13,0:13:51.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始觉得有点轻
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.67,0:13:57.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢变成无重力的状态
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.38,0:14:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,身体变的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.91,0:14:06.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常轻
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.15,0:14:08.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常轻..
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.99,0:14:15.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常的舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.63,0:14:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很轻..
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.97,0:14:29.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在太空的中心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.91,0:14:33.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感到非常愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.52,0:14:42.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是..
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.82,0:14:52.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你突然感到很热
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.44,0:15:09.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错，你慢慢来到了火星
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.68,0:15:15.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好热
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.62,0:15:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常热
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.83,0:15:30.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,身体热到不行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.27,0:15:36.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,热气从体内散发出来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.74,0:15:44.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,连体液都快被蒸发
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.02,0:15:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你满身大汗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.69,0:16:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但很快又被热得蒸发掉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.80,0:16:13.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太空射线也加重你的热力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.28,0:16:20.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你降落到火星了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.06,0:16:27.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很热吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.03,0:16:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好热..
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.90,0:16:38.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的好热..
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.47,0:16:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你流了很多汗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.44,0:16:47.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.18,0:16:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个..
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.22,0:17:02.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我受不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.27,0:17:11.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以脱衣服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.84,0:17:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.87,0:17:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得那样会好点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.54,0:18:22.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有凉快一点了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.81,0:18:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在..
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.81,0:18:35.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又回到太空的中心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.22,0:18:40.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且是裸体的状态
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.33,0:18:53.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,身边突然出现一群男人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.61,0:19:04.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一直盯着你的裸体看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.12,0:19:16.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你感到..非常羞耻
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.43,0:19:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.80,0:19:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要你听见我手指的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.51,0:19:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就会从这羞耻感中解放开来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.09,0:19:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,3、 2、 1
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.14,0:20:01.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你充满着性欲
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.54,0:20:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,身边那些看着你的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.32,0:20:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们还是盯着你看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.00,0:20:28.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,受不了了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.11,0:20:47.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的裸体，\N被那群男人拍下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.98,0:21:16.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的全身..
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.88,0:21:25.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你那淫荡的胴体..
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.86,0:21:28.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全被看光了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.24,0:21:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉如何太太？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.18,0:21:50.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.82,0:21:59.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是又好兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.76,0:22:01.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.16,0:22:11.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,光被看着
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.07,0:22:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已经满足不了你了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.51,0:22:23.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以喔
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.35,0:22:28.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以帮你解决性欲喔
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.46,0:22:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经..
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.97,0:22:53.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.22,0:23:12.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真忍不住了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.46,0:23:17.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我..\N请你摸我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.00,0:23:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.07,0:24:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续摸..
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.39,0:24:18.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是旁边很多人看着喔
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.56,0:24:28.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是我的身体热起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.34,0:24:35.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.58,0:25:09.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奶头怎么样了？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.52,0:25:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已经..
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.55,0:25:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,硬起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.69,0:25:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好有感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.71,0:25:45.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想要更爽吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.92,0:25:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想要更爽..
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.59,0:26:39.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奶头磨着了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.17,0:26:43.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好害羞喔
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.27,0:27:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,硬到不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.07,0:27:22.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续摸我
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.52,0:27:37.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在捏你的巨乳了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.13,0:27:46.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很多男人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.84,0:27:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都在捏你
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.27,0:27:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好有感觉喔
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.61,0:28:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太太
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.55,0:28:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在感觉如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.03,0:28:11.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好兴奋..
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.47,0:28:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.70,0:28:22.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服..
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.27,0:28:26.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能自摸喔
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.92,0:28:42.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太太，喜欢什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.46,0:28:55.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢肉棒..
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.34,0:29:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你周围都是肉棒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.16,0:29:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想要吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.83,0:29:21.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想要..
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.43,0:29:25.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我肉棒
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.27,0:30:02.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好有感觉..
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.77,0:30:04.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好想要肉棒
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.11,0:30:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快给我..
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.32,0:30:18.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下面好热..
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.86,0:30:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快给我肉棒
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.12,0:30:52.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我肉棒
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.59,0:31:02.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快把肉棒插进来..
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.41,0:31:17.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这么快要肉棒吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.49,0:31:29.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧，快给我肉棒
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.79,0:31:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我热到受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.43,0:31:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尽情干我的小穴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.71,0:31:50.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要主动，肉棒不会自己来的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.57,0:32:16.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小穴太爽了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.28,0:32:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要自慰到高潮，才会有肉棒
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.38,0:32:57.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快给我
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.85,0:33:05.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已经忍不住了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.96,0:33:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续爱抚着小穴
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.10,0:33:20.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要让自己更有快感
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.50,0:33:30.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用力吸我的奶
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.65,0:33:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乳房好有感觉喔
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.99,0:33:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用力吸
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.82,0:34:18.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你两边的奶，都很有感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.90,0:34:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常爽
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.07,0:34:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快高潮了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.46,0:34:56.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想要的肉棒
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.53,0:34:59.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自己过来要
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.30,0:35:05.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想要这根吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.31,0:35:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就在你面前了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.20,0:35:35.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.04,0:35:39.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好硬..
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.38,0:35:40.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好想舔
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.15,0:35:46.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好猛的肉棒
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.09,0:35:55.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以舔我的肉棒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.94,0:37:23.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舔肉棒很高兴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.36,0:37:40.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不继续舔的话
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.03,0:37:44.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会给你的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.61,0:38:30.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,整根夹住
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.49,0:38:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点干我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.74,0:38:57.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我好想要
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.18,0:39:07.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好想要..
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.75,0:39:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接着想怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.66,0:39:55.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想给你干
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.24,0:40:09.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干我的这里
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.38,0:40:12.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快给我肉棒
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.69,0:40:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好好张开，肉棒才会插入喔
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.97,0:40:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快给我肉棒
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.13,0:41:01.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,插进来了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.93,0:41:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好爽喔
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.03,0:41:14.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好好看着插入的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.06,0:42:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你感觉到自己越来越淫荡
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.70,0:42:14.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,越来越有快感
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.72,0:42:38.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续干我
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.30,0:42:49.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你最爱的肉棒
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.37,0:42:57.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不停高潮着
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.15,0:43:01.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爽到一直高潮着
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.54,0:43:25.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太有感觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.89,0:44:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要让你更爽了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.14,0:45:11.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还想要更爽吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.75,0:45:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爽到受不了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.25,0:45:27.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要自己寻求快感
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.33,0:47:11.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太爽了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.48,0:47:31.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高潮了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.61,0:47:56.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你最爱的肉棒，还没结束喔
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.90,0:48:20.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快进来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.15,0:49:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再来，让你更爽
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.32,0:49:51.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让你一直高潮
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.06,0:49:56.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的身体越来越敏感了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.88,0:52:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很有感觉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.91,0:54:01.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续干我
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.48,0:54:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用力
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.51,0:54:06.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还要吗
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.05,0:54:09.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全部射给我
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.05,0:54:13.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太太，你真的很淫荡
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.39,0:54:16.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常淫荡
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.66,0:54:25.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是很淫荡的，爽死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.34,0:54:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以中出你的淫穴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.58,0:54:43.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,中出我吧..全射给我
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.05,0:54:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的可以喔？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.29,0:54:56.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要射了\N全部中出我..
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.91,0:56:45.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.32,0:56:58.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.29,0:57:03.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚才很爽呢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.33,0:57:06.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想不起来了？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.96,0:57:10.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚才发生的事
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.53,0:57:15.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.21,0:57:26.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能跟老公说喔
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.78,0:57:34.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说出来，知道有什么后果吗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.22,0:57:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太太，下次我再来玩
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.80,0:58:21.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的公文包\N谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.14,0:58:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我出门了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.45,0:58:33.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.52,0:58:40.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个..\N老公
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.89,0:58:46.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.40,0:58:50.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.67,0:58:54.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.44,0:59:10.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你公司的那个上司..
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.75,0:59:13.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说田中吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.46,0:59:16.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.16,0:59:19.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.26,0:59:26.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不觉得他很奇怪吗\N哪里的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.44,0:59:34.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说上次他送我回来的事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.61,0:59:38.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯..
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.91,0:59:41.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不会怪啊，还很贴心
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.88,0:59:46.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快迟到了，我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.62,0:59:50.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,慢走..
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.66,1:00:26.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我又来了，太太
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.16,1:00:36.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天我带了他的同事给你认识\N也是我的部下
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.47,1:00:40.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到底是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.84,1:00:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快离开
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.68,1:00:48.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难得来了，怎么可以走
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.38,1:00:52.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是你忘记那些照片了？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.75,1:00:56.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这我很困扰
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.69,1:01:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是说啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.83,1:01:07.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟他说了你的事，\N他也对你很有兴趣呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.67,1:01:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他很喜欢巨乳
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.08,1:01:20.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快露出来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.85,1:01:23.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我办不到
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.59,1:01:27.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来你还是不懂
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.66,1:01:32.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你已经没选择的余地了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.46,1:01:34.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快给我脱
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.60,1:01:45.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,脱啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.54,1:02:53.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看这边
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.61,1:03:02.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请看..
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.36,1:03:09.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太太
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.89,1:03:12.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样哪看得见
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.50,1:03:25.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很淫荡的内衣呢
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.85,1:03:38.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快脱掉啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.06,1:03:52.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,转过来
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.97,1:03:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,转过来这边脱
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.68,1:04:46.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,内裤也脱掉
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.85,1:05:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太太
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.35,1:05:21.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这模样真不错
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.43,1:05:28.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以尽情欣赏喔
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.64,1:05:42.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好赞的奶
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.41,1:05:47.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想继续看吧\N嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.12,1:05:52.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别挡住
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.93,1:06:05.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快放开手
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.40,1:06:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放旁边
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.28,1:06:19.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太太
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.38,1:06:23.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跳起来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.82,1:06:29.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想看你的奶晃
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.24,1:06:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放过我..
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.74,1:06:50.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续跳
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.38,1:06:53.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不要
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.38,1:06:59.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别挡住
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.40,1:07:15.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样不够有趣
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.17,1:07:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,左右摇
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.64,1:07:55.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好赞的奶
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.38,1:07:58.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真受不了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.29,1:08:09.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,捏起来一定很舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.49,1:08:16.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,捏吧  真的可以？\N太太很喜欢的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.54,1:08:30.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好柔软
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.40,1:08:55.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的奶如何？\N大到包不住
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.64,1:09:08.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下面硬了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.48,1:09:11.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已经硬了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.56,1:09:18.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太太喜欢肉棒的\N给她看看
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.71,1:09:39.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太太，看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.55,1:09:42.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看他的巨棒
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.90,1:10:02.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.24,1:10:09.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实你很想舔吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.34,1:10:12.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以坦率一点
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.95,1:10:16.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.25,1:10:21.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太太，我知道你想舔的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.93,1:10:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实你很淫荡的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.77,1:10:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是最爱肉棒吗\N不是
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.54,1:10:42.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上次不是舔得很高兴吗\N才没有
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.95,1:10:49.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在可以舔喔
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.15,1:11:31.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,整根含进去才够爽
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.02,1:12:01.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续舔
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.24,1:12:55.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,双乳夹住肉棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.78,1:13:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太太，感觉如何？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.65,1:13:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有帮老公乳交吗
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.96,1:13:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有..
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.56,1:13:18.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.27,1:13:26.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不帮老公乳交，\N却帮他的同事做
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.59,1:14:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续帮我乳交
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.22,1:14:52.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太太，换你动了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.72,1:15:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真爽
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.22,1:15:54.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太太，真的好爽
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.14,1:16:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要射了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.86,1:17:08.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我吸干净
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.82,1:18:42.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好喝
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.19,1:18:47.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.13,1:18:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思，又上来打扰你们
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.70,1:19:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会，上次送我回家都没答谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.08,1:19:08.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊..
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.32,1:19:13.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上次太感谢了..
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.10,1:19:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的太太真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.27,1:19:33.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你娶到一个好老婆\N太害羞了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.91,1:19:38.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续喝吧\N嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.68,1:19:42.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真好吃
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.82,1:19:49.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好羡慕你每天都能吃到\N没有啦
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.16,1:19:53.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人美料理还做得这么好\N没有..
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.24,1:20:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样，拜托
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.28,1:20:14.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也想要了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.95,1:20:18.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,反正他又醉了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.59,1:20:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是要我再催眠你？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.40,1:20:38.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别反抗了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.34,1:20:43.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你根本就是很想要的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.80,1:21:06.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太太
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.23,1:21:17.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在变得很想要
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.91,1:21:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老公根本满足不了你
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.43,1:21:39.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的下面已经湿透了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.84,1:21:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要坦率面对自己喔，太太
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.30,1:22:12.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坦率一点
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.18,1:22:59.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很想要吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.21,1:24:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是摸一下
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.35,1:24:10.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这么敏感了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.81,1:24:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用忍耐
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.58,1:24:47.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让自己寻求快感
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.29,1:24:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一直寻求着
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.85,1:25:19.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好爽..
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.32,1:25:22.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好想要肉棒
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.58,1:25:48.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续摸我
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.84,1:26:14.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奶头变得很硬呢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.15,1:26:25.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太酥麻了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.33,1:27:09.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好有感觉喔
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.55,1:27:35.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很兴奋吧，看着我
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.71,1:27:58.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.94,1:28:00.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.26,1:28:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚才不是很想要吗
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.73,1:28:21.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道自已有多湿吗
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.00,1:28:25.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想要吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.97,1:28:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很想要肉棒吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.61,1:28:40.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和我做爱比老公更赞吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.59,1:28:45.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都知道的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.68,1:29:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老公会听见喔
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.15,1:29:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也不想被发现吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.33,1:29:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你很兴奋的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.48,1:29:40.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,越来越有感觉吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.20,1:30:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样捏爽吗
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.24,1:30:10.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会让你更爽的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.88,1:30:21.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,脱衣服给我看
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.09,1:30:31.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快脱
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.07,1:31:52.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别挡住，看不见
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.49,1:32:08.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样就对了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.66,1:32:13.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奶子有够大的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.30,1:32:18.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自己捏一下
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.18,1:32:26.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,捏给我看
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.93,1:32:46.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两边一起捏
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.07,1:33:22.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.94,1:33:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要我帮你吗
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.95,1:33:39.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很有快感吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.28,1:33:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会一直捏的
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.46,1:33:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这边呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.07,1:34:03.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你湿透了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.84,1:34:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,湿到不行
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.89,1:35:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好多爱液
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.79,1:35:32.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高潮的时候要说出来
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.87,1:35:36.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用硬撑的
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.49,1:35:57.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,湿到牵线了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.54,1:37:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又高潮了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.29,1:37:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,里面爽吗
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.64,1:38:34.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,湿到不行
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.95,1:39:08.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想要吗
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.01,1:39:42.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不戴套干炮感觉如何？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.49,1:39:49.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很爽吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.29,1:39:58.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不戴套爽吗
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.32,1:40:30.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的淫穴湿透了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.76,1:41:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,骑上来
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.66,1:42:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自己摇吧
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.13,1:42:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看着你老公做爱刺激吗
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.41,1:42:30.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,骑乘爽吗
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.80,1:43:56.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爽吧\N爽..
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.09,1:44:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的好淫荡
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.31,1:45:18.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,推车爽吗
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.88,1:46:27.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要高潮了..
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.13,1:47:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢跟我做吗
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.07,1:47:58.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你很享受的，太太
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.86,1:48:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要插到最深处了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.46,1:48:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太太，要射了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.67,1:48:57.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要在你老公面前中出
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.24,1:49:05.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样全射进去
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.75,1:49:15.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要..
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.83,1:49:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要射了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.89,1:51:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以了吗？JULIA小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.17,1:51:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我..接受不了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.77,1:51:17.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绕了我吧..
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.21,1:51:24.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都到这了还说这些干吗\N今天是要你当模特儿
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.08,1:51:31.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要脱..吗
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.36,1:51:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是不行..
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.33,1:51:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.06,1:51:44.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那只好听我的手指了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.28,1:51:54.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位，开始吧
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.85,1:51:59.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天她是模特儿
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.32,1:52:07.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天除了画脸
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.66,1:52:13.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们做什么都可以
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.20,1:52:18.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请你们尽情的享用她
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.50,1:52:22.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要开始了
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.69,1:54:17.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在自慰了
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.70,1:54:27.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好热喔
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.14,1:54:33.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以过来摸我吗
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.47,1:54:39.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.41,1:54:44.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.54,1:55:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尽情看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.58,1:55:16.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被看我会很兴奋的
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.17,1:55:40.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢我的身体吗
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.21,1:55:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想看哪里？\N我想看屁股
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.75,1:55:50.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,屁股吗
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.37,1:56:11.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:56:17.14,1:56:20.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,画我的这里
Dialogue: 0,1:56:25.15,1:56:27.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快画下来
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.85,1:57:06.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好有感觉喔
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.07,1:57:16.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续画啊
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.94,1:57:29.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要停
Dialogue: 0,1:57:42.19,1:57:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好有感觉喔
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.21,1:58:01.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,靠过来看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.56,1:58:14.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好有感觉喔
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.23,1:58:22.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我越来越兴奋了
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.66,1:58:50.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想摸我吗
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.63,1:58:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的肉棒怎么样了？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:04.98,1:59:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:59:12.25,1:59:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肉棒都硬起来了耶
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.69,1:59:20.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,靠过来给我看
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.84,1:59:43.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太赞了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.48,2:00:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好爽喔
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.44,2:00:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肉棒顶到奶头了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:56.02,2:00:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好多肉棒喔
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.61,2:01:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奶头好有感觉
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.15,2:01:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奶头好舒服喔
Dialogue: 0,2:01:50.74,2:01:53.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续给我
Dialogue: 0,2:02:00.25,2:02:03.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,射给我
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.94,2:02:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续射给我..
Dialogue: 0,2:02:31.95,2:02:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好舒服喔
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.50,2:02:53.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,射吧
Dialogue: 0,2:03:51.06,2:03:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小穴湿透了
Dialogue: 0,2:04:09.45,2:04:11.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好有感觉
